WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.408 --> 00:00:03.164
Unit eight. Media Literacy!

2
00:00:04.187 --> 00:00:08.994
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:09.044 --> 00:00:12.607
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.657 --> 00:00:16.492
Today we learn: Media Literacy. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.974 --> 00:00:21.607
Source. Say it with me. Source!

6
00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:29.074
Fake news. Say it with me. Fake news!

7
00:00:32.575 --> 00:00:36.541
Reliable. Say it with me. Reliable!

8
00:00:40.055 --> 00:00:43.555
Bias. Say it with me. Bias!

9
00:00:47.041 --> 00:00:51.175
Fact-check. Say it with me. Fact-check!

10
00:00:54.681 --> 00:00:58.581
Headline. Say it with me. Headline!

11
00:01:02.074 --> 00:01:05.940
Journalist. Say it with me. Journalist!

12
00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:13.324
Editorial. Say it with me. Editorial!

13
00:01:16.838 --> 00:01:20.271
Credible. Say it with me. Credible!

14
00:01:23.729 --> 00:01:27.929
Propaganda. Say it with me. Propaganda!

15
00:01:31.429 --> 00:01:35.879
Broadcast. Say it with me. Broadcast!

16
00:01:39.394 --> 00:01:43.111
Viral. Say it with me. Viral!

17
00:01:46.588 --> 00:01:56.732
Grammar time! Modal of possibility. Listen. This news might be fake. It could be biased.

18
00:01:56.782 --> 00:02:03.176
Your turn. Say it with me. This news might be fake. It could be biased.

19
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:14.565
Before sharing a headline, I always fact-check the source to make sure it is reliable, not fake news.

20
00:02:14.615 --> 00:02:16.014
I like this story!

21
00:02:16.722 --> 00:02:21.885
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:21.935 --> 00:02:23.085
Reliable!

23
00:02:24.215 --> 00:02:29.853
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:29.903 --> 00:02:31.209
Journalist!

25
00:02:32.215 --> 00:02:40.803
Think and answer. How can you tell if a news story is reliable?

26
00:02:40.853 --> 00:02:42.003
Great answer!

27
00:02:43.007 --> 00:02:45.613
This unit's value is Truthfulness.

28
00:02:45.663 --> 00:02:47.508
I can show truthfulness every day!

29
00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:53.712
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

30
00:02:53.762 --> 00:02:55.665
Bye-bye, friends!

